      "description": "The Tool-node barrel. `index.ts` merges every instance's `<stub>/tools/*.ts` into the one import five consumers use -- `check-tools`, `kg-export`, `harness-schema-export`, `tool-coverage` and the MCP projection -- so adding an instance is one line here rather than a path baked into five call sites. Declared by the ROOT rather than by `cat-harness` with repository scope: it is the checkout's own barrel over every instance, and repository-scoped entries from `cat-harness` are what put 15 paths under two declarations each.",
